  <h2>IPTV set-top box vs streaming stick: when a dedicated box makes sense</h2>
  <p>A MAG box or Android box can suit someone who wants one simple, dedicated device with a remote. For MAG boxes, message us your MAC address on WhatsApp, and we activate your subscription and send your portal links.</p>

